# Security & OWASP Rules
- Never concatenate unescaped input into SQL strings. Always use PDO prepared statements.
- Always include <?= csrf_field() ?> inside <form method="POST">.
- Escape all dynamic text in HTML views with <?= e($var) ?>.
- Use password_hash(..., PASSWORD_BCRYPT) and password_verify().
- Always enforce Auth::requireRole() in protected controller methods.
